[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14702.15, "timestamp": "04:05:02", "text": "大家都以为我懂编程之类的东西。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 14704.043, "timestamp": "04:05:04", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/5rHmZ4e5CJS3_9EP6970eAUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/5rHmZ4e5CJS3_9EP6970eA"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14704.79, "timestamp": "04:05:04", "text": "但实际上我并没有。我在这方面很差劲"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14706.309, "timestamp": "04:05:06", "text": "编码。我讨厌编程。我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14708.79, "timestamp": "04:05:08", "text": "理论太多了。我头疼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14713.349, "timestamp": "04:05:13", "text": "但你正在努力让它成功。猛击。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14715.59, "timestamp": "04:05:15", "text": "我认为正是因为如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14718.55, "timestamp": "04:05:18", "text": "对我来说，这简直难以承受。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14720.469, "timestamp": "04:05:20", "text": "就像，你是什么意思？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14722.389, "timestamp": "04:05:22", "text": "你就像，嗯，是啊，你知道的，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14724.389, "timestamp": "04:05:24", "text": "那一幕就像夏洛克·福尔摩斯一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14726.229, "timestamp": "04:05:26", "text": "他沉浸在自己的思维宫殿里，就像在做所有事情一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14728.07, "timestamp": "04:05:28", "text": "他脑子里那些计算就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14730.07, "timestamp": "04:05:30", "text": "我脑海里浮现的就是你做这件事的样子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14732.07, "timestamp": "04:05:32", "text": "哦，对，就是把这个那个放进去而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14733.59, "timestamp": "04:05:33", "text": "然后跳过这个循环"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14737.189, "timestamp": "04:05:37", "text": "得把它扔掉。是吗？你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14739.75, "timestamp": "04:05:39", "text": "你是什​​么意思？太疯狂了。这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14742.55, "timestamp": "04:05:42", "text": "只是个小人物。我甚至去了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14745.99, "timestamp": "04:05:45", "text": "就像你可能已经注意到的那样，有点过头了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14747.75, "timestamp": "04:05:47", "text": "在推特上。我写这些摘要是为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14750.87, "timestamp": "04:05:50", "text": "Joathon，推特上说得对。但如今，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14753.51, "timestamp": "04:05:53", "text": "以前的情况截然不同。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14755.99, "timestamp": "04:05:55", "text": "我有自己的网站。因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14758.95, "timestamp": "04:05:58", "text": "我不会编程，但我买了一辈子"}]